in her hands.

1808
01:10:02,265 --> 01:10:05,268
What good does that do me?

1809
01:10:05,302 --> 01:10:06,870
Well, look I got to get going.

1810
01:10:06,903 --> 01:10:08,138
It's be nice
talking to you kids.

1811
01:10:08,172 --> 01:10:10,507
You kids remember to
listen to your parents.

1812
01:10:10,540 --> 01:10:12,175
It's just possible
they might know

1813
