1814
01:10:15,712 --> 01:10:18,148
Always knew he was gonna blow.

1815
01:10:18,182 --> 01:10:19,983
But still a sweet guy.

1816
01:10:20,017 --> 01:10:21,318
Yeah.

1817
01:10:21,352 --> 01:10:23,120
