1845
01:11:34,758 --> 01:11:38,728
You know, I can't hold
back in a Whitman's sampler.

1846
01:11:38,762 --> 01:11:41,798
Pretty.

1847
01:11:41,832 --> 01:11:44,835
I could probably
duplicate that.

1848
01:11:44,868 --> 01:11:46,637
Probably some money there.

1849
01:11:46,670 --> 01:11:48,305
I could duplicate this mirror

1850
